  "move_pattern": "Cycles through Pressurize → Stomp → Ram → Siphon → Pressure Gun → Pressure Up → (back to Stomp). Continuously builds Steam Eruption power. When Steam Eruption reaches 6 stacks, monster becomes About to Blow (stunned), then Explodes for damage equal to total accumulated pressure.",
  "powers_on_spawn": [],
  "notes": "Steam Eruption is a unique power mechanic. Nearly all moves apply 3-20 stacks to the monster, which accumulates turn by turn. When pressure reaches maximum (6 buildup events trigger the threshold), the monster enters an unstoppable About to Blow state and then explodes. Pressure Gun has scaling damage that increases by 5 each turn. Siphon heals scale with player count. The Waterfall Giant is a phase-based threat that grows more dangerous as it builds pressure."
